# The envelope: every shape 0 to 15 on all three channels at a short
# period, a shape rewritten mid-cycle (which restarts it), periods 0, 1
# and long ones through both period bytes, the envelope gated by tones
# and noise, and a channel leaving and rejoining the envelope.
